<title>USA: SL Industries to buy back up to one mln shrs.</title>
<headline>SL Industries to buy back up to one mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MT. LAUREL, N.J. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SL Industries Inc said Wednesday its board of directors authorized the buy-back of up to one million shares in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the repurchased shares for various corporate purposes such as funding future acquisitions and stock option exercises.</p>
<p>The company's stock hit a 52-week high of 10-5/16 Wednesday afternoon, up 1/2. The company had about six million shares outstanding as of April 30.</p>
